from lesson_data import P,S,E,Q,finish
LESSON=finish(dict(number=11,prereqs=[2,10],lead=P("Follow data from an application to a network and back. Frame a TCP stream and build a finite local HTTP client/server experiment.","跟随数据从应用进入网络再返回，为 TCP 流分帧，构建有限本地 HTTP 客户端服务器实验。"),before=P("Know bytes, processes and threads. Labs use loopback 127.0.0.1 and an automatically assigned port; no external services are contacted.","了解字节、进程与线程。实验使用回环地址和自动端口，不访问外部服务。"),outcomes=[P("Describe network layers and addressing.","描述网络分层与地址。"),P("Explain DNS resolution.","解释 DNS 解析。"),P("Distinguish TCP streams and UDP datagrams.","区分 TCP 流与 UDP 数据报。"),P("Implement bounded message framing.","实现有界消息分帧。"),P("Interpret HTTP methods and statuses.","解释 HTTP 方法与状态。")],sections=[
S("Layers and packet delivery","分层与包传递","<p>Applications define messages; transport protocols connect endpoints; IP routes packets between networks; link technologies move frames across a local hop. Each layer adds information needed for its responsibility. A socket endpoint includes an address and port: the address identifies a network destination, while the port selects a service context. A packet can cross several routers; its route is not the same as an application-level conversation. Loss, delay and reordering are normal conditions a protocol must account for.</p>","<p>应用定义消息，传输协议连接端点，IP 在网络间路由包，链路技术在本地一跳传帧。各层添加自身职责所需信息。套接字端点有地址与端口，地址选目的地，端口选服务上下文。包可经过多个路由器，路线不同于应用会话。丢失、延迟与乱序都是协议需处理的情况。</p>","Why does a host need ports in addition to an IP address?","为何主机除 IP 还需端口？","To distinguish service endpoints on that host.","区分主机上的服务端点。"),
S("Names and DNS","名字与 DNS","<p>DNS maps domain names to records, including addresses. A resolver can consult caches and query the distributed hierarchy. Cached records have lifetimes; changing a record does not instantly update every client. A hostname is not inherently one permanent IP address. The URL also includes a scheme, path and possibly a port or query. Our lab uses numeric loopback to isolate protocol behaviour from external DNS and routing; it does not demonstrate a full public DNS lookup.</p>","<p>DNS 把域名映射到包括地址的记录，解析器查询缓存与分布层次。缓存有生存期，修改不会立即影响所有客户端。域名并非永久唯一 IP。URL 还有协议、路径、可能的端口和查询。实验用数字回环隔离外部 DNS 与路由，并非完整公网解析演示。</p>","Does changing a DNS record immediately invalidate all caches?","改 DNS 记录会立即使所有缓存失效吗？","No; cached records can remain until their allowed lifetime expires.","不会，缓存可能保留到生存期结束。"),
S("TCP and UDP","TCP 与 UDP","<p>TCP provides an ordered byte stream with transport-level reliability and flow control. It does not preserve application message boundaries: one send may require several reads, or several sends may arrive in one read. A zero-length recv result signals the peer has closed its sending side. UDP sends datagrams, retaining boundaries but not guaranteeing delivery or ordering. Choose around application requirements. A timeout indicates the caller did not complete in time, not that the peer definitely did no work.</p>","<p>TCP 提供有序字节流及传输可靠性与流控，不保留应用消息边界：一次发送可需多次读取，多次发送也可一次读取。recv 返回空字节表示对端关闭发送方向。UDP 保留数据报边界，但不保证交付或顺序。按应用要求选择，超时不代表对端一定没执行工作。</p>","Can recv(100) return fewer than 100 bytes?","recv(100) 可返回少于百字节吗？","Yes; loop until the frame's required bytes arrive or the connection ends.","可以，需循环到帧完整或连接结束。"),
S("Framing and defensive parsing","分帧与防御性解析","<p>A protocol can use delimiters, fixed widths or length prefixes. Our frame contains a four-byte unsigned big-endian length followed by that many UTF-8 bytes. Read the header exactly, validate the length against a maximum, then read the body exactly and decode it. Length counts bytes, not characters. The helper deliberately limits each recv to two bytes so partial reads are exercised. Reject truncated frames rather than silently treating partial content as a valid message.</p>","<p>协议可用分隔符、固定宽度或长度前缀。帧包含四字节无符号大端长度，后跟相应 UTF-8 字节。完整读头、验证最大长度、完整读体再解码。长度统计字节而非字符。辅助函数每次最多读两字节，明确练习部分读取。截断帧应拒绝，不能当有效消息。</p>","Why validate length before allocating or reading the body?","为何先验证长度再分配或读取？","To bound resource use from untrusted input.","限制不可信输入造成的资源消耗。"),
S("HTTP, HTTPS and request semantics","HTTP、HTTPS 与请求语义","<p>HTTP expresses requests with methods, targets and headers, and responses with status codes, headers and optional bodies. GET retrieves a representation; POST requests resource-specific processing. 200 indicates success; 404 indicates no matching resource. JSON is one body format, independent of HTTP itself. HTTPS uses TLS to authenticate the server and protect traffic under its trust assumptions. Encryption does not validate application input or authorise a user. Retrying a timed-out mutation needs an idempotency design to avoid duplicates.</p>","<p>HTTP 请求含方法、目标与头，响应含状态、头与可选体。GET 获取表示，POST 请求资源特定处理。200 成功，404 无对应资源。JSON 是一种体格式，不等于 HTTP。HTTPS 使用 TLS 验证服务器并保护传输，但不能替代应用验证与授权。超时后重试修改需幂等设计避免重复。</p>","Does HTTPS alone prevent SQL injection?","HTTPS 本身防 SQL 注入吗？","No; secure transport and safe database queries solve different problems.","不能，安全传输与安全查询解决不同问题。")],
labs=[dict(file="m11_stream.py",title=P("Frame a stream","流分帧"),intro=P("One finite server sends a frame and closes. The client assembles partial reads and checks a 1024-byte limit.","有限服务器发送一帧后关闭，客户端组装部分读取并检查 1024 字节上限。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Use UTF-8 text containing 中 and recompute byte length.</li><li>Advertise a longer body than is sent.</li><li>Advertise length 5000 and verify early rejection.</li></ol>","<ol><li>用含中的 UTF-8 文字并重算字节长度。</li><li>声明比实际更长的体。</li><li>声明五千长度，验证早拒绝。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>Encode first, then measure len(payload). A truncated body raises EOFError when the peer closes. Length 5000 fails before the body read. Keep worker joins and socket contexts so failing experiments release resources.</p>","<p>先编码再统计字节。截断体在对端关闭时抛 EOFError，五千在读取体前拒绝。保留等待线程和套接字上下文以清理。</p>")),dict(file="m11_http.py",title=P("HTTP catalogue response","HTTP 目录响应"),intro=P("Inspect the JSON body, content type and status. The server binds only locally and shuts down after the checks; http.server is a learning tool rather than a production server.","查看 JSON 体、类型与状态。服务器仅本地绑定并在检查后关闭；http.server 用于学习，不是生产服务器。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Add /health returning a small JSON object.</li><li>Return an empty list for an empty catalogue.</li><li>Explain why missing paths differ from zero matching books.</li></ol>","<ol><li>加入返回 JSON 的 /health。</li><li>空目录返回空列表。</li><li>解释缺失路径与零匹配图书的区别。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>A valid /health can return 200 with {'ok':true}. /books with [] is successful 200; /missing is 404 because the resource route does not exist. Keep Content-Length equal to encoded body bytes.</p>","<p>有效 /health 返回 200 与状态对象。/books 空列表仍 200，缺失路由为 404。Content-Length 应等于编码后的体字节数。</p>"))],
exercises=[E(1,"Endpoint","端点","What distinguishes two services on one IP?","同 IP 的两服务靠什么区分？","<p>Transport protocol and port, along with the address context.</p>","<p>传输协议与端口及地址上下文。</p>"),E(1,"Name versus address","名字与地址","Can a hostname map to several addresses?","域名可对应多地址吗？","<p>Yes; a name can have multiple address records and answers can change.</p>","<p>可以，多地址记录且答案可变化。</p>"),E(2,"Partial reads","部分读取","A six-byte body arrives as 2,1,3 bytes. How should the reader behave?","六字节分为二、一、三到达，如何读？","<p>Accumulate until total six; do not decode the incomplete body as a finished message.</p>","<p>累积至六，不把不完整体当完成消息解码。</p>"),E(2,"UTF-8 length","UTF-8 长度","What frame length should A中 advertise?","A中 声明多少帧长度？","<p>Four bytes, not two code points.</p>","<p>四字节，而非两码位。</p>"),E(2,"Status distinction","状态区分","GET /books returns [] versus GET /unknown. Statuses?","空 /books 与未知路径的状态？","<p>200 for a valid empty collection, 404 for an unknown resource.</p>","<p>有效空集合 200，未知资源 404。</p>"),E(3,"Retry ambiguity","重试歧义","A borrow POST times out after transmission. Can you assume it failed?","借阅 POST 传出后超时，能假定失败吗？","<p>No. The server may have committed while the response was lost. Use a stable request ID and stored result to deduplicate retries.</p>","<p>不能，可能已提交但响应丢失；用稳定请求 ID 与保存结果去重。</p>"),E(3,"Protocol contract","协议约定","Specify a bounded text-message format.","规定有界文字消息格式。","<p>Four-byte unsigned big-endian length, maximum 1024 bytes, followed by valid UTF-8. Reject oversized, truncated and invalid-encoding frames. Define whether zero length is valid.</p>","<p>四字节无符号大端长度，最多 1024 字节，随后有效 UTF-8；拒绝超大、截断与编码错误，规定零长度是否有效。</p>"),E(2,"Transport versus application","传输与应用","Does TCP reliability guarantee a database transaction committed?","TCP 可靠性保证数据库事务提交吗？","<p>No. Transport delivery is different from application validation, execution and commit; the application needs its own response contract.</p>","<p>不，传输交付不同于应用验证、执行与提交，需应用响应约定。</p>")],
quiz=[Q("TCP provides?","TCP 提供什么？","Ordered byte stream","有序字节流","One recv per send","每发送必对应一次读取","Automatic JSON","自动 JSON","Application framing is separate.","应用分帧另行定义。"),Q("UDP preserves?","UDP 保留什么？","Datagram boundaries","数据报边界","Guaranteed order","保证顺序","Guaranteed delivery","保证交付","Boundaries are not reliability.","边界不等于可靠性。"),Q("Length prefixes should count?","长度前缀统计什么？","Encoded bytes","编码字节","Visible letters only","仅可见字母","Code points always","总码位","The transport carries bytes.","传输承载字节。"),Q("HTTP 404?","HTTP 404 是什么？","Resource not found","资源未找到","Always network down","总网络断开","Success","成功","It is an application response status.","它是应用响应状态。"),Q("TLS replaces authorisation?","TLS 代替授权吗？","No","不能","Always","总能","Only locally","仅本地","Transport security does not grant access rights.","传输安全不授予访问权。"),Q("A timeout proves no server work?","超时证明服务器未执行吗？","No","不能","Always","总能","Only POST","仅 POST","The reply may be lost after work completed.","可能完成后响应丢失。")],pitfalls=[P("recv size is a maximum, not an exact-message promise.","recv 大小是上限，不承诺完整消息。"),P("Local success does not test internet routing, DNS or TLS.","本地成功不验证公网路由、DNS 或 TLS。")],reading=[(P("Python socket HOWTO","Python 套接字指南"),"https://docs.python.org/3/howto/sockets.html",P("Read send/recv and message framing; explain partial reads.","阅读发送接收与分帧，解释部分读取。")),(P("HTTP semantics RFC 9110","HTTP 语义 RFC 9110"),"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html",P("Read GET and status code definitions, not the entire specification.","阅读 GET 与状态码定义，无需全文。"))],terms=[(P("Framing","分帧"),P("Identifying message boundaries within transported data.","在传输数据中识别消息边界。")),(P("Idempotency","幂等性"),P("Repeated application has the same intended effect as once.","重复应用与一次的预期效果相同。")),(P("Loopback","回环"),P("Networking addressed back to the local host.","指向本地主机的网络通信。"))],review=P("<p>Trace a byte frame and an HTTP response separately. Explain what a timeout does not tell you. Module 12 persists catalogue state in a relational database.</p>","<p>分别跟踪字节帧与 HTTP 响应，解释超时不能证明什么。模块 12 将用关系数据库持久保存目录。</p>")))
